  {
   "type": "pub-image",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "色彩鲜艳的客厅采用赭色墙壁，搭配红色沙发和软垫凳。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "00345342"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/7f/cc/7fcc090ff3b35936a0f74816defbf45f.jpg"
